  "reflectionText": "I hate, I despise your feasts, and I will not delight in your solemn assemblies. Take away from me the noise of your songs. But let justice roll down like waters, and righteousness like a mighty stream. What is it to be told that what God wants is not your music but the river of justice you have not yet let run?",
